1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,440
In modern language, the equivalent weight is the molar mass divided by the n factor, the number of reacting units each formula unit supplies.

2
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,604
Equivalent weight is a relative number with no unit.

3
00:00:12,604 --> 00:00:16,731
Expressed in grams, it is called one gram equivalent.

